  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 2 difficulty 1 uses the direct public level-27 values; no interpolation is used.",
    "Lock On Target marks one target, while Teamwork Order and Targeting Order select two unique living opponents through deterministic Rule IR RNG.",
    "Felling Order resolves ten separately crit-capable 80% ATK Physical hits and ten independent resistible Bleed applications against every marked target.",
    "Each unshielded marked target schedules one 250% ATK Dismantle against a uniformly selected different living ally; a solo target produces an explicit no-op.",
    "Teamwork Order emits a permanent coordination marker tagged for the Automaton Grizzly Purge Order response and clears it after Felling Order.",
    "Phase three applies +60% base SPD on entry; each Targeting Order adds +20% base SPD up to two stacks.",
    "The three source-ordered phase action graphs, phase resets, target marks, damage, Bleed, shield guard, teammate follow-up, coordination handshake and speed progression use shared enemy lifecycle and Rule IR without a native handler."
  ]
